title: "Entanglement Hides the Representation, Not the Function"
abstract: "Three pre-registered CPU experiments on whether a license check can be entangled into a task's learned representation. Verdicts: CAPPED, POLYNOMIAL, INCONCLUSIVE. A negative result, scoped to a toy setup."
